Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:07.50,Sign_Basic,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1960,1001)\an1\fnArial\bord1.5\3a&HE0&\blur1\shad0\b1\fs22\pos(30,310)}23:14            Shoto Bunkamura Street (Outside the Veil)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.45,Main,Nitta,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go, Kugisaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.95,Main,Nitta,0000,0000,0000,,Remember what Nanami-san said?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:19.34,Main,Nitta,0000,0000,0000,,The whole reason they kept \Nquiet about Ieiri-san—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.95,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,...was to prevent me from doing \Nsomething reckless like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:27.38,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably why these people \Nwere late getting here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:30.46,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:35.59,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't be the only one going back \Nwhen those two are out there fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:36.97,Main,Nitta,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:38.92,Main,Nitta,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:00.95,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Episode 43\N{\fs30\fscy150}Right and Wrong, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:16.03,Show_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,825)\pos(320,10)\3c&H8ECEDD&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100\c&HDEDCE0&}Shibuya Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:43.10,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I should have asked Dagon \Nto leave a few more humans for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.43,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Still, this is plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.56,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:00.45,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.67,Main,Mob,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:13.04,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.08,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:07.69,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,She's wary of both my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:11.62,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,She must have heard the report \Nfrom that 7:3 sorcerer, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.35,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:25.16,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm only a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.79,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I can still alter my own shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.23,0:04:31.53,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't tweak transfigured humans
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:34.40,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,or interfere with the souls of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:41.54,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,So thanks for wearing your \Nnerves down all on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.20,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I already told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.17,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,that won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.04,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:54.08,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes you still have to try, \Ndespite knowing it's futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.44,Sign_Basic,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(917,1)\bord3\shad0\pos(430,140)\c&H555857&\3c&HFCFFFC&\b1}So stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:01.77,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:04.81,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hairpin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.58,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,She's jumping down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.16,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,What does this girl hope to achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:09.65,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Here's another!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:14.44,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hairpin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:17.88,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,She used the nails that had fallen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:22.39,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I've been thinking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:26.30,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,ever since I heard about your technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:29.06,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I bet this one will work nicely on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.14,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Resonance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.32,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:48.13,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:49.82,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:56.16,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Yuji Itadori wasn't my only natural enemy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:00.48,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:05.59,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I just felt my cursed energy \Nexplode far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:08.69,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,The pressure from your cursed \Nenergy is also lackluster,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:12.15,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,and you could have just taken \Nhold of me earlier, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.60,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:17.60,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,some kind of double who can't \Nuse its technique, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:20.71,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:35.95,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Her technique's aftereffects \Nare lingering a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:40.92,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I still can't get my body \Nto move like it should!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:47.67,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:50.21,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.58,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't save anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:59.40,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I caused everyone's efforts to end in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:01.90,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:07.89,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,You've let me believe that I'm not alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:09.41,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:11.90,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:16.16,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:18.98,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:21.88,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Now that Resonance is working,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:25.09,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,it shouldn't fire off \Nattacks as rapidly as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.94,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,This is where the real battle begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:33.42,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:36.31,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I'm running!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:38.81,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:40.31,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:44.06,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I could ignore it and head \Nstraight for floor B5,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.23,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,but if I let that thing run free,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:48.06,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,it'll just cause more issues later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:56.91,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Underground?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:58.79,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,This is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.98,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll exorcise it and keep \Nheading down to floor B5!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:10.08,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,It split apart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:11.42,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:17.60,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,One of them should have the fatal \Nportion of its soul for me to crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.10,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,You fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:25.11,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Shit! I got tricked by its cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.43,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,There are two Mahitos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:39.18,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,He had a double that was acting separately?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:41.86,Italics,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,So he's planning to merge \Nit back in and heal himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:08:59.23,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:05.72,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Run! Kugisaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:15.00,Main,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Hit you dead-on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:18.16,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,You're in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.28,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:23.60,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:28.35,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to completely finish off \Nthe 7:3 sorcerer with just one touch...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.47,Italics,Mahito,0000,0000,0000,,but what about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:46.06,Sign_Basic,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0}The Year 2009
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:55.56,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Die, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:59.20,Flashback,Fumi's Father,0000,0000,0000,,You're too naïve, Nobara-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:01.64,Flashback,Fumi's Father,0000,0000,0000,,You have to make sure you \Ncrush their chance to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:05.32,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,At the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:07.33,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:11.34,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I thought everyone in my village was crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:16.30,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,and I was convinced I was the only sane one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:23.00,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H213835&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:23.00,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1350,0)\3c&HA0DCE8&\pos(320,18)\c&H292619&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:28.01,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H213835&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:28.01,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1350,0)\3c&HA0DCE8&\pos(320,18)\c&H354F3E&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:40.44,Flashback,Fumi's Mother,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be using it until sixth grade, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:41.95,Flashback,Fumi's Mother,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:42.93,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:46.10,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,I know that's what my mother said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:49.04,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,but I chose the blue backpack anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:53.32,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,We moved to this village at the same \Ntime I was starting elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:57.45,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,My parents were worried about \Nthe inconveniences of the countryside,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:01.00,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,but I didn't like being \Nseparated from my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:05.49,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,There were nineteen \Nstudents in the whole school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:07.66,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Not just one class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:11.23,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone had either a red \Nor a black backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:14.40,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,I liked both red and black,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:18.07,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,but apparently everyone hated blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.84,0:11:21.09,Sign_Basic,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\bord2\shad0\c&H7FB2D7&\3c&HF6FBFA&\fs16\pos(336,172)}Cleaning Duty Chart\N{\fs12\c&HC2CECB&}Let's all keep our school clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:11:58.24,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:03.14,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:07.12,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:10.16,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,let's trade backpacks, Fumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:12.87,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.20,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's trade!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.63,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.79,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm number one in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.32,0:12:34.49,Flashback,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kugisaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.40,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:38.67,Flashback,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki! You again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.66,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:43.16,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.73,0:12:48.40,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,My backpack came back to me \Nbefore the day was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:51.22,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I hate all backpacks in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:52.62,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:56.62,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,After that day, Nobara-chan started \Ncoming over to my house a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:59.24,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,and playing video games with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.27,Flashback,Father,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten better at aerials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.69,0:13:07.01,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nobara-chan hated the other villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:10.43,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,It's such a small village
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:14.94,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,that it's harder to be \Nstrangers than friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:20.80,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,I thought, "Isn't that a good thing?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.84,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,When the old lady next \Ndoor brought red rice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.44,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,to celebrate my first \Nperiod several years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:32.56,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,I finally understood the creepiness \Nthat Nobara-chan was referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:37.11,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Fumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:40.44,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I found a secret base!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:49.13,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes Nobara-chan would say \Nthings you wouldn't expect from a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:51.39,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,but then she'd suddenly \Nsay things like that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:54.84,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,We're living here starting today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:59.24,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thinking back, those were probably \Nthings she picked up from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:01.36,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Like her mother, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.45,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:11.45,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nobara-chan's so-called secret base \Nwas just someone else's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:13.37,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:15.80,Flashback,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you really did come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:19.73,Flashback,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome. It's cold out, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:24.62,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,The girl's name was Saori-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:27.52,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,and she had moved into \Nthe village after I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:37.04,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,We always visited her out of the blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.09,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,and she always welcomed us \Nwithout a hint of displeasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:44.84,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it, \NSaori-chan was always at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:49.23,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nobara-chan changed \Nafter she met Saori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.23,0:14:52.52,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes! Why, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:54.44,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,You sound like Matsuko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.92,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Fumi, let me practice braiding your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:14:59.92,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:03.40,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Her speech grew softer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:08.01,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,and it felt like she started \Nto become more refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.17,0:15:12.08,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,We were both outsiders,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:15.59,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,but everything was different \Nbetween me and Saori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:21.36,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,A little while after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:24.24,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,things at Saori-chan's house \Nstarted to look strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:28.20,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,There was piled up trash, graffiti,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:31.05,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,snow that was clearly piled up in front \Nof it by someone else, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:35.06,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,It made her nice house \Nstart to feel unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:46.97,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Not too much longer after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.68,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Saori-chan moved away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:54.92,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,I saw her off together with Nobara-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:16:01.44,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't remember what the weather was \Nlike or what anyone said at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:09.07,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,I only remember Nobara-chan bawling \Nwith tears streaming down her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.57,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,I realized she could cry, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:17.68,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,and the shock of that meant \Nnothing else made it into my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:27.56,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,In June of this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:32.45,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nobara-chan was set to start \Ngoing to high school in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:41.66,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,She fought with her grandma over it, \Nand that apparently caused some delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:45.79,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'm never coming back here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:48.98,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,So make sure you get out of this \Nvillage at some point, too, Fumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.97,0:16:51.94,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:58.26,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,The awful thought of, "So she won't \Ncry for me," crossed my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:00.43,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,and left me unable to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:05.43,Italics,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,We never spoke of Saori-chan \Nagain after that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:10.09,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Fumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.64,Flashback,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make sure all three of us \Nare together when we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:39.15,Flashback,Fumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:59.24,Main,Coworker,0000,0000,0000,,Saori, why don't you rest for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:05.95,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I can't. The proofs are due today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:08.46,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,Or I guess yesterday at this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:11.28,Main,Coworker,0000,0000,0000,,It's still today until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.98,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh, I have a pimple!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:30.92,Main,Coworker,0000,0000,0000,,Shibuya's in trouble. Terrorism, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:36.44,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai, were you ever hoping to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:39.59,Main,Coworker,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Where'd this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:44.32,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I was just thinking it wasn't \Nsupposed to turn out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:48.38,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I moved out into the sticks during \Nmy second year of middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:49.45,Main,Senpai,0000,0000,0000,,A parent's work transfer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.45,0:18:54.24,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,No, my mother was a crazy woman who \Nwas into organics and spiritualism.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.39,Main,Senpai,0000,0000,0000,,I think I get the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:01.36,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,While I was there, I met these two girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:07.08,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,Seven years younger, I guess, and this one, \NNobara-chan, really took a liking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:11.68,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I was an only child,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:14.84,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,so I thought Nobara-chan \Nwas just the cutest thing ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:18.01,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,and I forced myself to act like an \Nolder sister, hoping she'd like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:26.00,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I even served them tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:29.36,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,For first graders!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:31.68,Main,Sempai,0000,0000,0000,,That's kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:38.78,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I never did give them \Nmy contact info, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:42.44,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I was afraid of us slowly \Ngrowing further apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:48.53,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,and she really cried her eyes \Nout when I left the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.84,0:19:50.90,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:55.94,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she would be disappointed \Nto see how I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:02.56,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I hope Nobara-chan's doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:05.97,Main,Saori,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where she is \Nand what she's up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:17.72,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,"Everyone in the village was crazy."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.32,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,That notion was never true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:23.94,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,But the crazy ones have the louder voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:26.89,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,and make it seem like they're all there is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.89,0:20:30.32,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,so they can trample all \Nover other people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:41.36,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Though I guess that \Nwasn't entirely the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:05.40,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Fumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:12.52,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't keep our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:20.58,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:22.29,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Tell everyone for me:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.57,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Life wasn't so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:53.96,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:28.01,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,When I first stepped off at Tokyo Station,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:32.36,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I was a bit grossed out because the air \Nsmelled like I was standing behind a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:34.80,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Now it doesn't bother me at all, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:36.87,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, "Right and Wrong, Part 3."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:39.93,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Right and Wrong, Part 3
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.87,0:23:39.55,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I guess life's all about the dirt we pick up.

